- Figure 8 is named in the text and assignment, but no identifiable Figure 8
  pixels are visible in the assigned text PNG. Figure 8 coverage is BLOCKED.
  This is not evidence that the application has omitted the figure.
- No left horizontal window with a visibly missing right-hand end was observed.
  The visible formulas and prose fit horizontally. Vertical boundary fragments
  are excluded from complete-block claims; their visible endpoints are recorded
